    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d220-a1">

                <pb facs="0365" n="253" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg253"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Duke Tsaitse to
                        Chargé Fletcher.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-01-16"><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi> 16,
                            1910</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: I was very favorably impressed by our
                    conversation of yesterday, and I had a conference with the officials of the
                    Wai-wu Pu this morning, repeating to them what you had said. A memorial will be
                    presented to the Throne within two or three days on the subject of our
                    conversation (or in the line of our conversation) and I was requested to inform
                    you of this fact.</p>
                <p>With best wishes, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tsaitse.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
